<title>COLOMBIA: Brewer Bavaria Colombia's hottest stock.</title>
<headline>Brewer Bavaria Colombia's hottest stock.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer Bavaria SA of the Santo Domingo business group was the most actively traded stock on Colombia's equity markets from last September through Februrary, the Securities Superintendency said.</p>
<p>It said Banco de Colombia, was the second most active followed by Cadenalco, the country's largest retailer in terms of size and sales.</p>
<p>Other most-actives on the country's exchanges in Bogota, Medellin and Cali, included cement maker Compania de Cementos Argos SA, Banco Ganadero and cigarette maker Compania Colombiana de Tabaco SA (Coltabaco).</p>
<p>((-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
